# Day 9 — Last Season. 10 September. Clear and cold; the first gold aspens.
# A postcard from Augie. Basin is closing. Ruth's piano. From today, Dot never says "over".

call D9_AM
  day 9
  time 06:20-12:00
  kind report
DOT  Kestrel, Basin. Readings.
choice
  > "Dry {dry}, wet {wet}. Wind {wind}." if obs_am set gave_readings -> read
  > "There's frost on the railing." -> frost
node read
THEO Basin, Kestrel. Dry bulb {dry}, wet {wet}. Humidity {rh}. Wind {wind}. Fuel stick {fuel}.
DOT  Copy.
goto plan
node frost
THEO Basin, Kestrel. There's frost on the railing. Just a little.
DOT  First of the year. The aspens'll go now. Watch them.
node plan
DOT  Supply run today. Hal's leaving it early. Augie sent you something.
DOT  No, I didn't read it. ...I read it.
do errand Fetch the supply box from the trailhead. Augie sent something.

call D9_POSTCARD
  day 9
  needs note_postcard
DOT  Kestrel, Basin. Well?
THEO "Is it F?"
DOT  He's been asking me that for twenty-two years. I don't know what it means. Do you?
choice
  > "Tell Augie it's E-flat. A little flat." if stair_heard set stair_is_eflat -> eflat
  > "Tell him it's F." -> f
  > "I haven't listened properly." -> notyet
node eflat
THEO Tell Augie it's E-flat. A little flat, even.
DOT  Ha! Ha. Oh, he'll be furious. He'll be delighted. Twenty-two years.
goto ps
node f
THEO Tell him it's F.
DOT  ...Liar. I can hear you smiling. I'll tell him.
goto ps
node notyet
THEO I haven't listened properly. The third stair. I'll listen.
DOT  You'd better. He'll call me about it.
node ps
DOT  And the rest of it?
choice
  > "He says you should go and see your sister." set ps_told -> tell
  > "Just a P.S. Nothing." -> nothing
node tell
THEO There's a P.S. He says you should go and see your sister.
DOT  ...
DOT  Copy. Basin out.
goto done
node nothing
THEO Just a P.S. Nothing important.
DOT  Kestrel. I read it. ...Thank you. Basin out.
node done
do errand_done

call D9_EVE
  day 9
  time 16:30-17:50
  retry 18:00
  kind report
DOT  Kestrel, Basin. Evening readings.
choice
  > "Dry {dry}, wet {wet}. Wind {wind}." if obs_pm set gave_readings -> read
  > "Cold. That's the reading." -> cold
node read
THEO Dry {dry}, wet {wet}. Humidity {rh}. Wind {wind}.
DOT  Copy. Basin out.
end
node cold
THEO Cold. That's the reading.
DOT  You're learning. Basin out.

call D9_PM
  day 9
  time 18:00-20:30
  retry 22:00
DOT  Kestrel, Basin. I need to tell you something and I need you to not make it a thing.
THEO Go ahead.
DOT  They're automating Basin. Relay towers on the ridges, a desk in Calder with a computer on it. This is the last season anyone sits in this chair.
THEO ...How long have you known?
DOT  Since April. I haven't told anybody. You're the first. Don't make it a thing.
choice
  > "What will you do?" -> what
  > "I'm sorry." -> sorry
  > [say nothing] -> quiet
node what
THEO What will you do?
goto piano
node sorry
THEO I'm sorry, Dot.
DOT  Don't be sorry. It's a chair.
goto piano
node quiet
DOT  ...Thank you for not saying anything. You're the only one who'd know how.
node piano
DOT  Ruth has our mother's upright. Nobody's played it since 2009. It probably sounds like a drawer full of forks.
choice
  > "I could tune it." set offered_tuning -> tune
  > "Pianos forgive a lot." -> forgive
  > [say nothing] -> silent
node tune
THEO I could tune it.
DOT  ...You'd come all the way to Calder to tune a piano nobody plays?
THEO Somebody might play it, if it was in tune.
DOT  ...Goodnight, Theo.
end
node forgive
THEO Pianos forgive a lot. More than people think. They want to be in tune.
DOT  ...Goodnight, Theo.
end
node silent
DOT  ...Goodnight, Theo.

call D9_NIGHT
  day 9
  time 21:30-26:00
  after D9_PM
  kind small
DOT  Theo.
THEO Dot?
DOT  ...Thanks. Basin out.
